---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Asynchronous failover losing confirmed writes. W1..W6 are illustrative write labels.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 352" role="img" aria-label="The old leader holds writes W1 to W4 and told clients OK for all of them, but only W1 and W2 reached the follower. When the leader dies and the follower is promoted, new writes W5 and W6 take the places of W3 and W4, so W3 and W4 are lost although they were confirmed.">
    <text x="406" y="34" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>copied up to here</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chép được tới đây</tspan></text>
    <line x1="406" y1="42" x2="406" y2="170" class="edge bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={80} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="85" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Old leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader cũ</tspan></text>
    <rect x="250" y="58" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="286" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W1</text>
    <rect x="330" y="58" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="366" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W2</text>
    <rect x="410" y="58" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <text x="446" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W3</text>
    <rect x="490" y="58" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <text x="526" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W4</text>
    <text x="570" y="85" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>W3 and W4: told "OK", not yet copied</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>W3 và W4: đã báo "OK", chưa chép</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={150} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="155" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <rect x="250" y="128" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="286" y="155" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W1</text>
    <rect x="330" y="128" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="366" y="155" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W2</text>
    <rect x="410" y="128" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box empty" />
    <rect x="490" y="128" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box empty" />
    <text x="570" y="155" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>never received them</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chưa bao giờ nhận được</tspan></text>
    <line x1="290.0" y1="184.0" x2="290.0" y2="217.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="290.0,226.0 294.5,217.0 285.5,217.0" class="head " />
    <text x="306" y="210" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>old leader dies, this follower is promoted</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>leader cũ chết, follower này được đề bạt</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={252} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="257" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>New leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader mới</tspan></text>
    <rect x="250" y="230" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="286" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W1</text>
    <rect x="330" y="230" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="366" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W2</text>
    <rect x="410" y="230" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="446" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W5</text>
    <rect x="490" y="230" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="526" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">W6</text>
    <text x="570" y="257" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>new writes reuse the places</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lần ghi mới chiếm chỗ</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>W3 and W4 were confirmed to clients, and now exist nowhere.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>W3 và W4 đã được báo thành công cho client, và giờ không còn ở đâu cả.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The loss comes from the gap between "confirmed to the client" and "copied to a follower". Whatever sits in that gap when the leader dies is gone.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mất mát nằm ở khoảng hở giữa "đã báo cho client" và "đã chép sang follower". Thứ gì nằm trong khoảng hở đó lúc leader chết thì mất luôn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
